                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-12-18"><hi rendition="#italic">December 18,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. White reports that immediate cash payment need not necessarily be large,
                    recognition of the principle rather than amount of payment being the
                    question.)</p>
            </div>
